<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1419449691"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1497589938"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Colors (feat. Shion)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Kirara Magic / Shion"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Colors (feat. Shion)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:44.410"><div begin="00:01.920" end="02:44.410"><p begin="00:01.920" end="00:08.720" itunes:key="L1">音に乗せれば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">配合上这音乐</span></p><p begin="00:08.720" end="00:15.080" itunes:key="L2">色が変わっていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">色彩随之发生改变</span></p><p begin="00:15.080" end="00:20.770" itunes:key="L3">透明な心が空に浮かぶ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">透明的心漂浮于空中</span></p><p begin="00:20.770" end="00:28.340" itunes:key="L4">小さな 星が待っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小小闪耀的星辰在等待着</span></p><p begin="00:28.340" end="00:34.760" itunes:key="L5">懐かしいな 優しさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份温柔令人怀念</span></p><p begin="00:34.760" end="00:40.950" itunes:key="L6">冬の寒さを 溶けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寒冬的冰冷已消融</span></p><p begin="00:40.950" end="00:45.740" itunes:key="L7">暖かい夢のハーモニー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">温暖梦境的共鸣</span></p><p begin="00:45.740" end="00:48.600" itunes:key="L8">Stay with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我在一起</span></p><p begin="00:48.600" end="00:53.160" itunes:key="L9">世界が鮮やかに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界被浸染上缤纷色彩</span></p><p begin="00:53.160" end="00:57.160" itunes:key="L10">染まって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">染上颜色</span></p><p begin="01:24.510" end="01:31.070" itunes:key="L11">大切な君へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着最珍重的你 歌唱我的心意</span></p><p begin="01:31.070" end="01:37.430" itunes:key="L12">想いを歌うよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把这份思念歌唱</span></p><p begin="01:37.430" end="01:42.980" itunes:key="L13">季節は巡り 変わってゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">季节不断循回往复 不断变化</span></p><p begin="01:42.980" end="01:50.010" itunes:key="L14">どんな色を 付けているんだろ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟会被沾染上怎样的色彩</span></p><p begin="01:50.010" end="01:54.940" itunes:key="L15">あ カラフルな日々のシンフォニー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊</span></p><p begin="01:54.940" end="01:57.620" itunes:key="L16">Color with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我一起上色</span></p><p begin="01:57.620" end="02:02.010" itunes:key="L17">目に映る君に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿触碰到眼眸中映射的你</span></p><p begin="02:02.010" end="02:05.940" itunes:key="L18">触れたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想触碰你</span></p><p begin="02:29.370" end="02:35.460" itunes:key="L19">はあ 色あせた日々の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 在暗淡的日夜中</span></p><p begin="02:35.460" end="02:43.550" itunes:key="L20">君がくれた 幸せな言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你赠予了我 幸福的话语</span></p><p begin="02:43.550" end="02:44.410" itunes:key="L21">Dream with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我共梦</span></p></div></body></tt>